// Copy this file to Signing.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in the
// team from your Apple Developer account. Debug.xcconfig and
// Release.xcconfig include the copy, so it reaches every configuration of
// the Runner target; the project file names no team itself. Signing is
// automatic: Xcode uses the team's Apple Development certificate and
// creates the iPhone team profile on the first device build. The simulator
// build needs no team, which is why the include is optional.

// Team ID from https://developer.apple.com/account → Membership.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
